# Flood Map runs entirely on free, no-key data sources by default:
#   - Geocoding : Nominatim (OpenStreetMap)   -> proxied via /api/geocode
#   - Elevation : AWS Terrain Tiles (terrarium) -> proxied via /api/tiles
#
# No environment variables are required to run the demo.
#
# Optional future provider (not wired by default). The elevation layer in
# src/geo/elevationTiles.ts is structured so a Mapbox Terrain-RGB provider
# could be dropped in later for higher resolution / satellite drape:
# VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
